# Syndication Mod files
#
# I have organized the mod files so that all the data associated with
# an item, for example, are together in a single file, to make it easier
# to create and debug specific gear, classes, characters, and stories

# Factions
#
# Each faction file contains all the associated data for the following
# tables as needed:
#
# Faction, Tag

Factions.json

# Contact Classes
#
# Each contact class file contains all the associated data for the following
# tables as needed:
#
# ContactType, ContactService, Tag

ContactTypes.json

# Contacts
#
# Each contact type file contains all the associated data for the following
# tables as needed, including story elements to introduce them:
#
# ContactBackstory, Tag, CosmeticGroup, Block, BlockCondition, StoryNode, StoryMatch, Legwork

Contact_Dragons_CasinoOwner.json
Contact_Dragons_SynBlade.json
Contact_Dragons_SynFinance.json
Contact_Ricksham_Railmaster.json
Contact_Ricksham_SynBlade.json
Contact_Yakuza_SynBlade.json
Contact_Yakuza_SynBoss.json
Contact_Yakuza_SynFinance.json

# Services
#
# Each contact class file contains all the associated data for the following
# tables as needed, including story elements to operate the service:
#
# ContactService, Tag, Block, BlockCondition, StoryNode, StoryMatch, Legwork

Service_Gambling.json
Service_Replicas.json
